Step 5 of epoch:planned-reasoning-build-list. Anthony accepted all of the trials' gaps as their own phase on 2026-10-19.
FIRST: the served argument skill, objections aimed at a step, and per-line assumptions.
THEN:
- "not an inference";
- contested instead of unproven;
- a reply that concedes and moves;
- what-ifs on contested conclusions;
- the read-back of a dispute both ways;
- a write that turns a claim refuted says so;
- statement kinds for an objection, a reply, an unstated premise and a method rule;
- an argument held in its project with gaps that fit;
- what a claim rests on;
- the small faults.
flo2's half is 1a97fc1f1de4d5d2:epoch:planned-p6-flo2-chat-reads-the-argument-skill.
